flowchart TD
  Timer[Polling interval] --> Twitch[Fetch stream state from Twitch]
  Twitch --> Candidates[Load tracked users and prior snapshots]
  Candidates --> Select[Match streams to configured tracking rows]
  Select --> Changed{State changed?}
  Changed -->|yes| Discord[Send or edit Discord card]
  Changed -->|no| Persist[Keep current snapshot]
  Discord --> Persist[Persist latest stream snapshot]
  Persist --> Timer
  Twitch -->|error| Retry[Log failure and poll again later]
  Retry --> Timer
